- setCameraView({ projection, azimuthDeg, elevationDeg, rollDeg, axisScreenAngles, obliqueAngleDeg, depthScale, zoom, target, heightFraction, distanceScale }) for source-matched camera setup
  heightFraction: fraction of viewport height the content should fill (default 0.5; use 0.65–0.75 to fill more). Omit zoom — the scaffold auto-fits from projected scene bounds.
- setUiLayout('overlay' | 'right' | 'bottom', sizePx?) — where the #ui panel lives. The scaffold ALWAYS auto-docks #ui
  to 'right' (or 'bottom' on narrow viewports) instead of floating it over the figure, and grows the dock to fit the
